Here's some info from DEC...
http://ftp.europe.digital.com/pub/DEC/axppci/

Com 1 and 2 are the pair by the keyboard connector. If you have PS/2 key +
mouse, the keyboard is the one closer to the com port headers.

from the AXPpci33 Design Guide...
Pin:
1	DCD
2	Serial In
3	Serial Out
4	DTR
5	Ground
6	DSR
7	RTS
8	CTS
9	RI
10	No Pin Installed

